          "quote": "Let $E^r_{p,q}$ be a homological spectral sequence in an abelian category, first quadrant from page $2$, with specified finite abutment to $H_n$ and increasing filtration normalized by $F_{-1}H_n=0$, $F_nH_n=H_n$ for $n\\ge0$. There is an exact sequence\n$$H_2\\longrightarrow E^2_{2,0}\\xrightarrow{d^2}E^2_{0,1}\\longrightarrow H_1\\longrightarrow E^2_{1,0}\\longrightarrow0.$$\nThe maps adjacent to homology are the edge maps. No initial injectivity of $H_2\\to E^2_{2,0}$ is asserted.",
