          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "If $Z\\subseteq X$ and $\\overline Z\\subseteq\\operatorname{int}_X(A)$, then\ninclusion $(X-Z,A-Z)\\to(X,A)$ induces isomorphisms\n$H_n(X-Z,A-Z;G)\\cong H_n(X,A;G)$ for every $n$.",
