          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For every CW complex $X$, abelian group $G$, and $n\\geq0$, the cellular complex has an\nisomorphism $H_n^{\\mathrm{cell}}(X;G)\\cong H_n(X;G)$, natural with respect to\ncellular maps.",
