          "claim": "The ambient cylinder is contractible, so its positive-degree homology vanishes by [F6]. Its pair long exact sequence from [F2], together with step 2.1, gives $H_2(X_\\tau)=0$ from the segment $H_3(B,X_\\tau)\\to H_2(X_\\tau)\\to H_2(B)$, and gives an isomorphism $\\partial:H_2(B,X_\\tau)\\to H_1(X_\\tau)$ from the segment $H_2(B)\\to H_2(B,X_\\tau)\\xrightarrow{\\partial}H_1(X_\\tau)\\to H_1(B)$. Thus $H_1(X_\\tau)\\cong\\mathbb Z^r$.",
