          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For homomorphisms $f:K\\to G$ and $h:K\\to H$, let $N$ be the normal closure in $G\\ast H$ of $$\\{j_G(f(k))j_H(h(k))^{-1}:k\\in K\\}.$$ Then $(G\\ast H)/N$, with the induced factor maps $j_G$ and $j_H$, is a pushout of $f$ and $h$.",
