        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "By [F1], each $f_\\pm$ induces an isomorphism on topological $H_1$ and an epimorphism on topological $H_2$. Naturality of [F2] identifies the $H_1$ map with the map between the abelianizations of $\\pi_1(P_\\pm)$ and $\\pi_1(X_\\tau)$. Thus each group homomorphism $(f_\\pm)_*$ is an isomorphism on group $H_1$.",
