      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "Write $E(u)=1+U$ and $E(\\lambda)=1+V$ with $U,V\\in\\mathfrak m$. Then\n$$\nE(u^{-1}\\lambda u)-E(\\lambda)\n=(1+U)^{-1}V(1+U)-V.\n$$\nExpand $(1+U)^{-1}=\\sum_{a\\geq0}(-U)^a$. The term with no $U$ on either side is $V$ and cancels the subtracted $V$. Every remaining term is a product $(-U)^a VU^b$ with $a+b\\geq1$.",
