        {
          "id": "step-1-3",
          "claim": "At a fixed vertical line, every point of $Z$ lies above all link points on\nthat line. Since every link height is at most $0$, the straight homotopy\n$(x,y,z)\\mapsto(x,y,(1-t)z+t)$ ($0\\le t\\le1$) stays above those link points\nand contracts $Z$ onto the plane $z=1$. This plane is contained in $Z$, so\n$Z$ is contractible.",
